    "caption": "⚡️ Agile business model is growing rapidly, and the platforms behind it must be able to handle the workload of millions of people at the same time.\n⠀\nThe host of the meetup is Ganjiguur - participant of the Silkway Accelerator Program in partnership with Google for Startups.\nGanjiguur is experienced in building scalable systems with AWS, Azure, Kubernetes and Google Cloud. The company he works for develops the largest cloud platform (www.cloud.mn) in Mongolia, and AWS is a partner.\n⠀\nIf you want to know the differences between cloud platforms and main points to consider for a scalable system, please feel to come to the meetup!\n⠀\n❗️Registration of participants via the link in the profile description (taplink).",
